[API Documentation]
Logistic log probability distribution function.

  JAX implementation of :obj:`scipy.stats.logistic` ``logpdf``.

  The logistic probability distribution function is given by

  .. math::

     f(x) = \frac{e^{-x}}{(1 + e^{-x})^2}

